    "Initial catalog probe asserted a clean project after first viewer presentation. The final probe checks unchanged document revision/descriptors and reports view-preference dirty state separately.",
    "First Linux builds ended with SIGHUP. Their original process handles were absent and build logs confirmed termination; preserved interruption logs and restarted builds passed.",
